\! neon_local endpoint create ep_test_76 --branch-name test_branch_76 --pg-port ${BRANCH1_PORT}
\! neon_local endpoint start ep_test_76
Starting existing endpoint ep_test_76...
Starting postgres node at 'postgresql://cloud_admin@127.0.0.1:55435/postgres'
-- Step 3: Verify data inherited on branch
\c - - - :branch1_port
You are now connected to database "postgres" as user "cloud_admin" on host "127.0.0.1" at port "55435".
