           checkpoint            
---------------------------------
 BRANCH - Inherited data sample:
(1 row)

SELECT id, data, value 
FROM test_large_76 
WHERE id IN (1, 5000, 10000)
ORDER BY id;
  id   |    data    | value 
-------+------------+-------
     1 | data_1     |     1
  5000 | data_5000  |  5000
